[65.8043, "o", "\r\n"]
[65.9129, "o", "The discount function had two bugs:\r\n"]
[66.2280, "o", "1. BULK discount required total > 5000, but should apply at >= 5000 (test at minimum).\r\n"]
[66.8200, "o", "2. BULK discount returned the discount amount instead of the discounted total.\r\n\r\n"]
[66.8875, "o", "Fixed both in shop/discounts.py:\r\n"]
[67.0935, "o", "- Changed `total > BULK_MINIMUM` to `total >= BULK_MINIMUM`\r\n"]
[67.3854, "o", "- Changed `int(total * RATES[code])` to `int(total * (1 - RATES[code]))` for BULK\r\n\r\n"]
[67.8046, "o", "All tests now pass. Verified with pytest.\r\n"]
[67.8082, "o", "  ◇ careful a read-only checker is reviewing the result\r\n"]
[143.1332, "o", "  ✓ careful check · 2 tool calls · 75s · nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b\r\n"]
